{"title": "Roasted Dwarf Leg", "pageid": 17264, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Roasted_Dwarf_Leg", "categories": ["Bugs", "Misc items", "Common items", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png/300px-FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/9/9b/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Roasted Dwarf Leg image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png/300px-FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Leg_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A non-edible item. Can be consumed by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">The Dark Urge</a> to recover <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">4d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Gamey and succulent. Whoever this belonged to, they led an active life.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-14d2764f2d292b35END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0da12e7da6a555fcEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a4bc4cdff4163893END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">QUEST_GOB_RoastingDwarf_C</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_GOB_RoastingDwarf_C\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_GOB_RoastingDwarf_C\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">dc83c211-ef84-4e54-96c4-94aadbd3184a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dc83c211-ef84-4e54-96c4-94aadbd3184a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dc83c211-ef84-4e54-96c4-94aadbd3184a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_RoastingDwarf_Meat</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_RoastingDwarf_Meat+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_RoastingDwarf_Meat+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Several are placed on the spit over the bonfire in <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-103&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;444</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Only <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">The Dark Urge</a> can consume this item, and doing so grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_One#Good_Ol'_Long_Pig\" title=\"Haunted One\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Good Ol' Long Pig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_One#Good_Ol'_Long_Pig\" title=\"Haunted One\">Good Ol' Long Pig</a> inspiration. Its healing properties only display when examined by The Dark Urge; other characters and companions refuse to eat it.</li>\n<li>These are presumably the remains of <a href=\"/wiki/Brian\" title=\"Brian\">Brian</a>, one of the members of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aradin_Beno\" title=\"Aradin Beno\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/25px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/38px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/50px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aradin Beno\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/25px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aradin_Beno\" title=\"Aradin Beno\">Aradin Beno</a>'s group of adventurers.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item does not cost any <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">action</a> to consume in combat, but triggers on-heal effects, which can be very useful. See <a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\">healing</a> for a full list of such items.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roasted_Dwarf_Belly\" title=\"Roasted Dwarf Belly\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/FOOD_Grilled_Pork_Belly_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Roasted_Dwarf_Belly\" title=\"Roasted Dwarf Belly\">Roasted Dwarf Belly</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roasted_Dwarf_Ribs\" title=\"Roasted Dwarf Ribs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/FOOD_Grilled_Roth%C3%A9_Ribs_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Roasted_Dwarf_Ribs\" title=\"Roasted Dwarf Ribs\">Roasted Dwarf Ribs</a></span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715064205\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expi